---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Logo from '../components/Logo.astro';
import Arrabel from '../components/Arrabel.astro';
---

<BaseLayout>
	<header class="hero">
		<div class="overlay">
			<Logo color="var(--white)" />
			<p class="tagline">pedacitos y piececitas</p>
			<p class="description">
				A virtual magazine featuring your news, art, and interests.
			</p>

			<div class="cta">
				<a
					href="https://huesera.eo.page/"
					class="button standard"
					target="_blank">Subscribe</a
				>
				<a href="/submissions" class="button standard">Submit Here</a>
				<a href="/archive" class="button standard">Archive</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</header>

	<main>
		<h1 class="issue-title halloween">TWISTED TALES FROM THE UNDERWORLD</h1>

		<section class="intro">
			<br />
			<p>
				<i
					>Como un sueño de loco sin fin / la fortuna se ha reído de
					ti</i
				>
			</p>
			<p>
				Hark! Witches circle the skies! A howl shatters the silence of
				night! Spirits walk the earth! The veil thins, and our world
				grows stranger. Here at Huesera we want to celebrate all things
				paranatural and supernormal. This issue is dedicated to the
				things that go bump in the night, to otherworldly visitors,
				uncanny occurrences, and our collective fascination with the
				bizarre and the unexplained. We want to hear your spooky
				stories, real or imagined. We want to hear about your personal
				experiences with witchcraft and spiritism. We want to see your
				photos of orbs and apparitions. What are your favorite horror
				movies? What's the scariest book you've ever read? Share with
				us!
			</p>
		</section>

		<section id="calls" class="calls">
			<h2>Calls for Submissions</h2>
			<h3 class="due">Deadline November 8th, 2025</h3>
			<p>
				We're aiming to release the next issue in mid-November. Feel
				free to send in multiple submissions! If you have any specific
				formatting requests please let us know. Contributors will be
				sent a proof of their sections on Nov. 10th for final approval
				and revisions.
			</p>
			<div class="cta">
				<a href="/submissions" class="button standard">Submit Here</a>
			</div>
			<br />
			<hr />
			<article>
				<h3>FEATURED - ALL OF THEM WITCHES</h3>
				<p>
					We want to know about your relationship with witchcraft and
					what it means to you. Did you grow up in a witchy family? Do
					you get cleanses or read tarot cards? Have you ever done a
					spell? Do you think you've been cursed? Tell us all about
					it!
				</p>
			</article>
			<article>
				<h3>FEATURED - FALLING FOR FALL</h3>
				<p>
					Last issue we said goodbye to summer, now we want to know
					how you welcomed autumn! Did you go to the pumpkin patch?
					Did you have your first PSL? Did you dress up for Halloween?
					We want to see pictures and hear your stories.
				</p>
			</article>
			<article>
				<h3>FEATURED - MIDNIGHT CAMPFIRE</h3>
				<p>
					Has something paranormal ever happened to you? Ever seen a
					specter? Felt a hand on your back? Maybe someone told you
					something real scary once. Or maybe you have a knack for
					crafting bloodcurdling tales. We want to hear your spooky
					stories, whether they are true or fictional!
				</p>
			</article>
			<article>
				<h3>DARK AND STORMY TUNES</h3>
				<p>
					<a
						target="_blank"
						href="https://open.spotify.com/playlist/0SJLXhWwHGIBiEVNkOspni?si=22Hvu7wqQgyBHJ7da1pPkA&pt=dc60e535e45de122e5a3abfca80414f0&pi=G5eGQ24ITyKab"
						>Contribute to our Halloween playlist!</a
					>
				</p>
			</article>

			<article>
				<h3>ARTS</h3>
				<p>Photos, drawings, poems, in-depth media reviews.</p>
			</article>

			<article>
				<h3>FOR FUN RESEARCH</h3>
				<p>
					Share an article about a research rabbit hole you've
					explored.
				</p>
			</article>

			<article>
				<h3>FITNESS</h3>
				<p>
					Ran, lifted, or achieved a goal? Send us your fitness
					updates.
				</p>
			</article>

			<article>
				<h3>FOOD</h3>
				<p>
					Cooked something delicious or visited a great restaurant?
					Tell us!
				</p>
			</article>

			<article>
				<h3>PERSONAL</h3>
				<p>
					Moving, changing jobs, or celebrating milestones? Share your
					news.
				</p>
			</article>
			<hr />
		</section>

		<section class="media"><Arrabel color="var(--white)" /></section>
	</main>
</BaseLayout>
